  <div class="h2row"><span class="secnum">8</span><h2>Measurement Dashboard</h2></div>
  <div class="tblwrap"><table>
    <thead><tr><th>Metric</th><th>Definition</th><th>Direction</th><th>Cadence</th><th>Owner</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><b>Files idle &gt; 7 days</b></td><td>% of active pipeline with no logged action in 7 days</td><td class="down">↓ toward &lt; 5%</td><td>Weekly</td><td>Supervisors</td></tr>
      <tr><td><b>Login-to-disbursal conversion</b></td><td>Disbursed ÷ logged-in, cohort basis</td><td class="up">↑</td><td>Monthly</td><td>Business head</td></tr>
      <tr><td><b>Stage TAT</b></td><td>Median days per stage, by dept</td><td class="down">↓</td><td>Weekly</td><td>Dept heads</td></tr>
      <tr><td><b>Commitment-kept rate</b></td><td>Authored recommit dates met ÷ made</td><td class="up">↑ toward &gt; 85%</td><td>Weekly</td><td>Supervisors</td></tr>
      <tr><td><b>Stall-recovery rate</b></td><td>Files idle &gt; 7 days later disbursed ÷ total stalled</td><td class="up">↑</td><td>Monthly</td><td>Business head</td></tr>
      <tr><td><b>Fake-lead rate</b></td><td>Verification failures ÷ leads created</td><td class="down">↓</td><td>Monthly</td><td>Integrity</td></tr>
      <tr><td><b>Post-approval competitor loss</b></td><td>Look-back hits ÷ lost conditional approvals</td><td class="down">↓</td><td>Quarterly</td><td>Integrity</td></tr>
      <tr><td><b>SM productivity</b></td><td>Disbursed files / SM / month</td><td class="up">&lt; 1 → &gt; 1.5</td><td>Monthly</td><td>Business head</td></tr>
      <tr><td><b>Nudge-to-action rate</b></td><td>Nudges acted on within 24 hrs ÷ sent</td><td class="up">↑ (health check for fatigue)</td><td>Weekly</td><td>Program owner</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table></div>
</section>

<!-- ============ 9 PHASING ============ -->
<section id="phasing">
  <div class="h2row"><span class="secnum">9</span><h2>Phasing — Definition of Sequence, Not Implementation Plan</h2></div>
  <div class="phases">
    <div class="phase">
      <div class="ph">P1 · 0–90 days</div>
      <div class="bd">
        <div><b>Scope</b><br>Pilot: 2 branches, MSME-LAP only</div>
        <div><b>Interventions live</b><br>I-2, I-3, I-6, I-7 + 24-hr verification calls</div>
        <div><b>Must prove</b><br>Idle-file % halves; SMs use the queue voluntarily; fake-lead deterrence visible</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="phase">
      <div class="ph">P2 · 90–180 days</div>
      <div class="bd">
        <div><b>Scope</b><br>Pilot branches, full depth</div>
        <div><b>Interventions live</b><br>I-1 chase automation, I-9 cross-dept clocks, full diversion playbook (§5)</div>
        <div><b>Must prove</b><br>Stage TAT compression; conditional-approval save rate up</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="phase">
      <div class="ph">P3 · 180+ days</div>
      <div class="bd">
        <div><b>Scope</b><br>Region-wide rollout</div>
        <div><b>Interventions live</b><br>Behavior signatures, risk tiers, incentive re-weighting, leaderboards (I-5, I-8, §6)</div>
        <div><b>Must prove</b><br>SM productivity &gt; 1; sustained without novelty effect</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="callout green" style="margin-top:18px;"><b>Open decisions before implementation:</b> final SLA values (calibrate to 6-month TAT history) · incentive re-weighting approval (revival bonus, quality-weighted targets) · which function owns integrity review · snooze caps per role.</div>
</section>

